  "Allah says\n\u201cIf you avoid the major sins which you are forbidden.\nWe will remove from your lesser sins and admit you to a noble entrance into paradise\u201d\nMajor Sins:\n21 - Slandering innocent women \u2013 Falsely accusing chaste women brings severe punishment.\n22 - Stealing from war booty and Zakat \u2013 Taking unlawful share from public funds is sinful.\n23 - Consuming forbidden wealth \u2013 Earning through haram means is prohibited.\n24 - Committing highway robbery \u2013 Spreading terror and looting is a grave crime.\n25 - Making false oaths \u2013 Lying under oath is a serious sin.\n26 - Committing oppression \u2013 Injustice and tyranny are condemned.\n27 - Levying illegal taxes \u2013 Exploiting people financially is sinful.\n28 - Stealing \u2013 Theft leads to the punishment of amputating hands.\n29 - Suicide \u2013 Taking one\u2019s own life is forbidden in Islam.\n30 - Perpetual lying \u2013 Habitual lying leads to Hellfire.": "2026-10-05T05:21:45.568769",
  "Whenever SAW given choice of one of two matters\nHe would choose the easier of the two,\nas long as it was not sinful to do so\nbut if it was sinful to do so, he would not approach it.": "2026-10-05T05:21:45.568769",
